    English (en). It is the neutral catalog too, declared with NeutralLanguage
    in the project, so English needs no satellite assembly.

    Visible text catalog for GUI_Register (CU-02). Rule RN-14 requires every
    visible string to come from a resource catalog and to be stored in Unicode.
    The supported languages are English and es-MX, and only those two (D-21);
    the schema enforces the pair with CK_Usuario_idioma.

    The three variants must hold exactly the same keys.
  -->
